			"text": " inspect     Display detailed information on one or more images -> docker image inspect alpine\n rm          Remove one or more images -> docker image rm alpine\n pull        Download an image from a registry -> docker image pull alpine -> docker image pull alpine\nprune       Remove unused images -> docker image prune\n ls          List images -> docker image ls",
			"rawText": " inspect     Display detailed information on one or more images -> docker image inspect alpine\n rm          Remove one or more images -> docker image rm alpine\n pull        Download an image from a registry -> docker image pull alpine -> docker image pull alpine\nprune       Remove unused images -> docker image prune\n ls          List images -> docker image ls",
			"fontSize": 20,
